  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening capacities of the Lebanese Armed Forces enabling stability and early recovery of affected communities and livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The project seeks to strengthen the capacities of the Lebanese Armed Forces (LAF) as a cornerstone of stabilization efforts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;It is articulated around four main activities that seek to enhance the LAF&#xbf;s ability to lead stabilization efforts, strengthen security, restore trust in the State, and support both immediate recovery and the expansion of state authority. Support under this intervention will be complementary to the assistance to be delivered through the European Peace Facility. Specifically, the intervention aims to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support urgent removal of rubble and unexploded ordnance&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support LAF high impact stabilization interventions  &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Enhance LAF civil and military cooperation (CIMIC) and coordination&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Procure essential equipment &amp; supplies to enhance LAF operational readiness &amp;amp; deployment in southern Lebanon&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
